	title = {Acoustic similarity laws for centrifugal fans.},
	abstract = {In order to verify acoustic similarity laws for fans, experiments were performed with three, dimensionally similar, centrifugal fans of 140, 280 and 560mm impeller diameter. The fans were connected to anechoically terminated discharge ducts. The result was in agreement with earlier studies. From the experimental results it was concluded that fan noise data taken from model fans can be extrapolated to other dimensionally similar fans of different size for arbitrary fan speeds and working fluids, provided that the operating condition and the measurement position are the same. (English abstract)},
